      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Framework**\n\nOkay, I'm setting up the groundwork. I'm focusing on creating a `partial_results.py` Python file to manage streaming recognition events. My current thought is to use Google Cloud Speech-to-Text as the external provider. This selection provides a solid foundation for the implementation.\n\n\n**Implementing the Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Speech-to-Text. I will start implementing the `partial_results.py` file. My focus is on writing code that clearly differentiates and handles partial and final results from Google's API, likely importing the relevant module. My plan involves creating a demo function for processing API responses.\n\n\n",
