      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Provider Options**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Speech-to-Text as the external provider. Now, the next step is to initiate the file creation, specifically, the `stream_chunks.py` Python file.\n\n\n**Defining Streaming Implementation**\n\nI'm now fully committed to Google Cloud Speech-to-Text. I will start constructing the `stream_chunks.py` file. Inside, I intend to define an async generator. This generator will receive an audio source and produce `speech.StreamingRecognizeRequest` objects. These requests will then be streamed to Google Cloud Speech-to-Text. The code will import the `google.cloud.speech_v1p1beta1` library.\n\n\n",
