      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Architecture**\n\nI'm solidifying the architecture for the `stream_microphone.py` script. The key is to select a speech-to-text provider, and I've settled on Google Cloud Speech-to-Text for its robust features. This choice needs to be explicitly reflected in the code design.\n\n\n**Implementing the Speech-to-Text**\n\nI'm now implementing the core functionality of `stream_microphone.py`, using Google Cloud Speech-to-Text. The audio input stream will be set up, and I will create a generator for audio chunks. The next steps involve configuring the client and handling API responses to yield interim transcripts. I plan to use `asyncio` and `queue` for asynchronous processing.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789867803588,
          "start": 1789867798441
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc6f2fa9001CAyTeUQhuDmkbC",
